1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,481
You're a vampire.

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:04,009
Your neighbours have asked you to hunt one.

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,315
Rabenfels.

4
00:00:05,315 --> 00:00:06,916
Seventeen thirty-two.

5
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,065
They know you as Elias,

6
00:00:09,065 --> 00:00:09,843
the clerk.

7
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:12,415
You write their letters after dark.

8
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:14,361
Pay your rent on time.

9
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:15,980
At the tavern,

10
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:18,005
Marta saves your usual seat.

11
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,296
Its back faces the mirror.

12
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:22,985
Matthias,

13
00:00:22,985 --> 00:00:23,815
the blacksmith,

14
00:00:23,815 --> 00:00:25,019
calls you a friend.

15
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:27,681
He fixed your door before the winter.

16
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,687
You buy sheep's blood from the butcher.

17
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:33,257
Enough to keep your neighbours safe.

18
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,435
Until this morning.

19
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,458
A man was found drained in the square.

20
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,668
You never fed on him.

21
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:45,193
Now Matthias is sharpening the hunters' blades.

22
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:48,401
And Marta has hidden a witness upstairs.

23
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:51,806
The watch expects an answer before dawn.

24
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,019
What's your first move?

25
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,164
Top comment decides.

26
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:58,716
Its author joins the town.
